            "block_content": "2 Effective May 24, 2009, an Escalation Adjustment will be determined by computing the percentage increase in CPI-W, between March 2008 and March 2009. If the percentage increase of the CPI-W minus the current year's GWI percentage is positive, 70% of net positive difference will be added to the 2009 GWI.",
